-- Class Sample Builds: Seer (Animist): https://2e.aonprd.com/ClassSamples.aspx?ID=74
-- Class Sample Builds: Sky King Eternal (Exemplar): https://2e.aonprd.com/ClassSamples.aspx?ID=76
